# VHS tape: modforge search demo
# Run with: vhs demo/search.tape
# Requires: modforge installed, GITHUB_TOKEN env var (optional)

Output demo/search.gif
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Type "modforge search 'Create' -m 1.21.10 -l neoforge"
Enter
Sleep 5s
